<SiteLayout title="School Closings | Growing Kids" description="Find out how Growing Kids shares school closing updates through its parent app and Facebook page, or call your center to confirm." breadcrumbs={[{name:"School Closings",path:"/school-closings/"}]}><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><h1>School Closings</h1><p class="intro">If a Growing Kids center closes for the day, families are notified through their parent engagement app and the Growing Kids Facebook page. You can also call your child’s center to confirm.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/book-a-tour/">Schedule a Tour</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section cream"><div class="wrap split"><div><h2>Check your family’s updates.</h2><p>Watch your parent engagement app for center messages. A local school district closure does not by itself establish whether your Growing Kids center is closed.</p><a class="button secondary" href="https://www.facebook.com/people/Growing-Kids-Learning-Center/100063635740171/">Growing Kids On Facebook</a></div><div><h2>Call your center.</h2><p>For the status of your child’s school, use its direct phone number.</p><a class="text-link" href="/locations/">Find center phone numbers</a><p><a href="/resource-policy-library/">Read family policies</a> · <a href="/faqs/">See common questions</a></p></div></div></section>
